  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Fig. 4, 'Overview of key immunization processes'. Two swimlanes. Vaccination location management holds A. vaccination location registration, G. resolve duplicate client records, H. resolve duplicate vaccination events, I. report generation, and a grey 'Supply chain management' box not covered by this kit. Vaccination location runs from Start through B. plan service delivery into a Service Delivery area: C. client registration, D. administer vaccine, then 'All vaccine series complete?'; yes ends the process, no leads to E. client reminder and 'Overdue for a dose?', where yes leads to F. defaulter tracing and no to the end. Each workflow box carries a subprocess marker.",
